00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:14.540
Yes, what is it?

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:19.050
Don't forget about me either.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:24.390
Don't ever erase me from your heart.

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:26.700
What's this all of a sudden?

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:34.040
Sorry for saying something strange.  Forget about it.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.720
Okay.

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:38.950
Japanese is pretty difficult.

