00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:34.970
Are you doing the preview properly?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.100
Seika-sama!

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.140
Next time on Princess Lover!  Look forward to it!

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:39.150
Question!

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:40.950
